---
const stages = [
  { state: 'In use', title: 'Publish an owner edit', text: 'The owner saves an exact Markdown change. The private owner app has committed it, published it and verified the live page.', url:'research/owner-self-dogfood/', link:'Owner editing evidence' },
  { state: 'Tested privately', title: 'Review a reader’s correction', text: 'On a private test site, a reader suggests a change. Approve records the decision; Apply puts it on the page. Public suggestions are not offered on Cyberbase.', url:'development/approved-proposal-input/', link:'What Apply accepts' },
  { state: 'Design goal', title: 'Bring a different editor', text: 'A site could replace the Quartz form with a SolidJS interface. A shared client interface and a working Solid proposal adapter are still to be built.', url:'design/editing-and-trust-roadmap/', link:'Client integration roadmap' },
];
---
<figure class="track not-content">
  <figcaption>How the contribution path can grow</figcaption>
  <p class="intro">These are levels of evidence, not release dates. Each new interface must pass the same source checks.</p>
  <ol>{stages.map((s) => <li><span class="state">{s.state}</span><strong>{s.title}</strong><p>{s.text}</p><a href={`/cyberbaser/${s.url}`}>{s.link}</a></li>)}</ol>
  <div class="rail"><strong>What stays fixed</strong><span>One owner-controlled source. Only selected content goes out. Only authorized, exact changes go back.</span></div>
  <p class="test"><strong>A stability test:</strong> someone corrects a sentence that has since changed. Whether the suggestion came from Quartz or a future Solid editor, Cyberbaser must refuse the stale edit, not guess where to write.</p>
</figure>
<style>
.track{container-type:inline-size;color:var(--sl-color-white);margin:2rem 0;min-width:0;border-top:2px solid currentColor;padding-top:1rem}.track figcaption{font-weight:600;font-size:1.2rem}.track p,.track ol,.track li,.track .rail,.track .intro,.track .test{margin:0}.track .intro,.track .test{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--sl-color-gray-2);max-width:70ch}.track ol{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));padding:1.5rem 0 1rem}.track li{position:relative;min-width:0;border-top:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3);padding:.75rem 1rem 0 0}.track li::before{content:'';width:.6rem;height:.6rem;position:absolute;left:0;top:-.34rem;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--sl-color-accent-high);background:var(--sl-color-black)}.track li:first-child::before{background:var(--sl-color-accent-high)}.track li:last-child{border-top-style:dashed}.state{display:block;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--sl-color-accent-high)}.track li strong{display:block;line-height:1.35;margin:.35rem 0}.track li p,.track li a{font-size:.88rem}.track li a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.4rem}.track .rail{display:grid;gap:.2rem;background:var(--sl-color-gray-6);padding:.8rem 1rem}.track .test{margin-top:.65rem}.track .rail span{font-size:.9rem}@container(max-width:580px){.track ol{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:1rem 0}.track li,.track li:last-child{border-top:0;border-left:1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-3);padding:0 0 1rem 1.15rem;margin-left:.32rem}.track li:last-child{border-left-style:dashed;padding-bottom:0}.track li::before{left:-.36rem;top:.35rem}}
</style>
